1
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:33,050
Open your mind. Open your mind.

2
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:50,010
Far beyond the deep blue Earth,
you and I shall meet...

3
00:00:50,010 --> 00:00:51,380
...as a gentle breeze goes by.

4
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:56,850
AH! MY GODDESS

5
00:00:56,850 --> 00:01:03,990
A snow-white feather will come
fluttering down, swaying gently in the air.

6
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:11,100
Without holding back, I want to
envelope you, my one and only love.

7
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:20,510
I know I have the power to protect
the one I love, right here in my hands.

8
00:01:20,510 --> 00:01:27,250
Open your mind.
Just as I've always dreamed.

9
00:01:27,250 --> 00:01:34,160
Let the wind carry off
your hopes, faraway.

10
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:40,930
I have wings nobody can see.
Look, you have them, too.

11
00:01:40,930 --> 00:01:49,240
They'll take us to where we can be free.
Anyone can be free.

12
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:53,740
The sky is so blue...

13
00:02:02,150 --> 00:02:07,460
همم.. إذًأ الأرضيون يحبون
مثل هذه الأمور, هاه؟

14
00:02:07,460 --> 00:02:10,290
مالذي تنظري إليه, أورد؟

15
00:02:10,290 --> 00:02:12,090
.لا علاقة لكِ, إنه ليس للأطفال
.تفضل

16
00:02:12,090 --> 00:02:12,590
.لا علاقة لكِ, إنه ليس للأطفال

17
00:02:12,590 --> 00:02:12,790
